  "m_dialogList": {
    "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.ActorDialogList, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
    "m_dialogs": [
      {
        "m_dialogTag": "Prep",
        "m_dialogEntries": [
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "KM-NIBB-NPC04_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "It was Nana, not the book, that made the call to use repurposed jelly. Which is why the Gummies radiate local color.",
            "m_picture": "",
            "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_003|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/Orson_003_41.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1506489,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "KM-NIBB-NPC04_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "The Gummies interface with tourists from different worlds, pick up their habits and expressions, which become suspended in their jelly matrix.",
            "m_picture": "",
            "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_003|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/Orson_003_42.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1506489,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "KM-NIBB-NPC04_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "When that jelly was used to make the Gobblerstopper, all those mannerisms escaped and synergized with everything around them.",
            "m_picture": "",
            "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_003|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/Orson_003_43.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1506489,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "KM-NIBB-NPC04_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "The question is... how to bubble that synergy. The book says: \"add soda water and apples to stabilize the mixture.\" Ah, that's why we didn't do it.",
            "m_picture": "",
            "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_003|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/Orson_003_44.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1506489,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "KM-NIBB-NPC04_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Apples is Krok for Brudels, which are pests; even Gobblers shouldn't eat them. But, if you insist, get some Apple Peels from the Brudels outside.",
            "m_picture": "",
            "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_003|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/Orson_003_45.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1506489,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "m_dialogTag": "Underway",
        "m_dialogEntries": [
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "KM-NIBB-NPC04_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "You need Apple Peels and Soda Water to shut off the Everlasting Gobblerstopper. Go fight the Brudels outside.",
            "m_picture": "",
            "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_003|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/Orson_003_46.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
